 guaranteed that all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cnt"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"len"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] is even. After that iterate similary on length of sticks and greedily merge pairs from 2 sticks with the same length in fours. It will be length of sides of sought-for rectangles, left only summarize their squares in answer. In the end can left 2 sticks without pair, we must not consider them in answer. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cnt"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"[5] = 6, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cnt"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"[4] = 4, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cnt"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"[2] = 4, we need to merge this sticks in following way — (5, 5, 5, 5), (5, 5, 4, 4), (4, 4, 2, 2). Two sticks with length 2 are left, we must not count them. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Asymptotic behavior of this solution — O("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"maxlen"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minlen"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" — count of sticks, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"maxlen"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" — maximal length of stick, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minlen"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" — minimal length of stick."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/525/D"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"525D — Arthur and Walls"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To solve this problem we need to observe next fact. If in some square whith size 2 × 2 in given matrix there is exactly one asterisk, we must change it on dot. That is if in matrix from dots and asterisks is not square 2 × 2 in which exactly one asterisk and three dots, then all maximum size of the area from dots connected by sides represent rectangles. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now solve the problem with help of bfs and this fact. Iterate on all asterisks in given matrix and if only this asterisk contains in some 2 × 2 square, change this asterisk on dot and put this position in queue. Than we need to write standart bfs, in which we will change asterisks on dots in all come out 2 × 2 squares with exactly one asterisk. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Asymptotic behavior of this solution — O("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" sizes of given matrix."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/525/E"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"525E — Anya and Cubes"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To solve this problem we need to use meet-in-the-middle. At first sort given array in increasing order and divide it in two parts. In first part must be first "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" / 2 elements, in second part — other. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Iterate all submasks of all masks of elements from first part. That is iterate which cubes from first part we take and on which from them we paste e